WEBVTT

00:03:29.997 --> 00:03:31.374
Oh my gosh.

00:03:31.415 --> 00:03:32.750
Are you kidding me?

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.418
You all are amazing.

00:03:34.418 --> 00:03:36.379
OK, you can put your drawings back down,

00:03:36.379 --> 00:03:37.672
tuck them under,

00:03:37.713 --> 00:03:39.048
put them on the paper.

00:03:40.049 --> 00:03:41.217
That was wonderful.

00:03:41.259 --> 00:03:43.719
I mean, they're all terrible,
but they're wonderful.

00:03:43.719 --> 00:03:44.887
Why are they wonderful?

00:03:44.929 --> 00:03:47.473
Because you all just drew a face.

00:03:47.473 --> 00:03:48.683
You drew what you saw.

00:03:48.724 --> 00:03:51.644
You didn't draw what you think
a face looks like, right?

00:03:51.644 --> 00:03:55.398
You also just did something
that people rarely do.

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:59.068
You just made intimate eye-to-eye,

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:03.197
face-to-face contact with someone
without shying away